  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Icod.Terminal 1.9.0 adds protocol-neutral unsolicited semantic terminal events and completes interactive Kitty OSC 99 notification reporting for activation, buttons, close, and close-tracking-unavailable results through the existing authoritative TerminalSession.ReadEventAsync(...) path. Interactive reporting remains explicit opt-in, existing notification calls remain compatible when new options are unused, malformed/oversized owned reports recover boundedly, and active query responses retain routing precedence. The stable 1.0 compatibility floor remains unchanged. Full notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.9.0/docs/releases/1.9.0.md ; compatibility: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.9.0/docs/Compatibility-and-Versioning.md",
